  "notes": "Two event delivery mechanisms: (1) the built-in Hooks system (entity+action → HTTP POST with X-Mifos-Entity / X-Mifos-Action / X-Mifos-Platform-TenantId headers), and (2) the Business Events pipeline that publishes to Kafka or ActiveMQ JMS (disabled by default, recommended for high-volume production). Multi-tenant — the tenant ID is always in webhook headers."
